WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.076 --> 00:00:09.463
Gildong went with the candlemaker to see the landowner.

2
00:00:09.464 --> 00:00:11.304
"I'm here to pay my debt."

3
00:00:11.305 --> 00:00:16.477
The candlemaker gave the landowner a sack of rice.

4
00:00:16.478 --> 00:00:24.718
The landowner stroked his beard. "Where's the interest?"

5
00:00:24.719 --> 00:00:30.227
"Don't you think the interest is too high?" Gildong said.

6
00:00:30.228 --> 00:00:32.924
The landowner crossed his arms.

7
00:00:32.925 --> 00:00:35.467
"That man agreed to pay.

8
00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:39.565
If he can't, he will become my servant.

9
00:00:39.566 --> 00:00:46.332
That should teach him a lesson."

10
00:00:46.333 --> 00:00:53.058
"Fine," Gildong said. "I'll pay."

11
00:00:53.059 --> 00:00:57.015
He waved his fan. "Day one."

12
00:00:57.016 --> 00:01:00.766
The rice doubled, bursting the sack.

13
00:01:00.767 --> 00:01:06.292
The landowner's eyes went wide. "What's happening?"

14
00:01:06.293 --> 00:01:08.655
"I'm paying the interest."

15
00:01:08.656 --> 00:01:12.424
Gildong kept waving the fan.

16
00:01:12.425 --> 00:01:16.198
The rice doubled and doubled.

17
00:01:16.199 --> 00:01:20.426
"Day 15. Day 16."

18
00:01:20.427 --> 00:01:24.617
Rice rose up to the landowner's nose.

19
00:01:24.618 --> 00:01:28.325
The room creaked as it filled with rice.

20
00:01:28.326 --> 00:01:32.897
"Day 19."

21
00:01:32.898 --> 00:01:36.526
"Okay! Okay!" the landowner said.

22
00:01:36.527 --> 00:01:42.634
"The debt is paid. Stop, before you destroy my house!"

23
00:01:42.635 --> 00:01:44.839
"That should teach you a lesson."

24
00:01:44.840 --> 00:01:51.425
Gildong folded the fan, and the rice disappeared.

25
00:01:51.426 --> 00:01:55.424
One sack sat in front of the landowner.

26
00:01:55.425 --> 00:01:57.816
Gildong glared at him.

27
00:01:57.817 --> 00:02:07.390
"If I ever hear about your cruel loans again, I'll be back."

28
00:02:07.391 --> 00:02:10.642
Gildong was quiet all afternoon.

29
00:02:10.643 --> 00:02:15.839
He was sad that so many people were poor and hungry.

30
00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:23.287
He was sad that landowners gave out unfair loans.

31
00:02:23.288 --> 00:02:27.719
"What's wrong, little lord?" Nabi asked.

32
00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:31.746
"I'm glad we helped the people in town," Gildong said.

33
00:02:31.747 --> 00:02:34.712
"But I wish we could do more."

34
00:02:34.713 --> 00:02:37.332
Mok slapped him on the back.

35
00:02:37.333 --> 00:02:47.850
"You're smart, boss. Maybe you can think of something."

36
00:02:47.851 --> 00:02:56.451
Soon Gildong knew just what to do.

37
00:02:56.452 --> 00:03:00.705
He gathered everyone to announce his plan.

38
00:03:00.706 --> 00:03:04.813
"Many people in this kingdom need help," he said.

39
00:03:04.814 --> 00:03:09.038
"So from now on, we won't just steal for ourselves.

40
00:03:09.039 --> 00:03:12.341
We'll give what we steal to poor people.

41
00:03:12.342 --> 00:03:16.194
And we'll only steal from greedy nobles and officials."

42
00:03:16.195 --> 00:03:22.174
The bandits cheered.

43
00:03:22.175 --> 00:03:26.161
"Our group needs a name," Chibong said.

44
00:03:26.162 --> 00:03:28.696
Mok scratched his head.

45
00:03:28.697 --> 00:03:33.129
"What can we call a group that helps the poor?"

46
00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:38.231
Gildong smiled. "The Hwalbindang!"

47
00:03:38.232 --> 00:03:43.135
"Hooray for the Hwalbindang!" everyone cried.

48
00:03:43.136 --> 00:03:46.962
"What should we do first?" Mok asked.

49
00:03:46.963 --> 00:03:52.319
"I heard that farmers in Hamheung are starving," Chibong said.

50
00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:55.674
"The governor takes all their grain as tax.

51
00:03:55.675 --> 00:04:00.989
If they don't have grain, he takes whatever else they have."

52
00:04:00.990 --> 00:04:04.273
"That's horrible!" Nabi said.

53
00:04:04.274 --> 00:04:09.142
"The government storehouse must be so full," Gildong said.

54
00:04:09.143 --> 00:04:14.092
Mok grinned. "Let's rob it."

55
00:04:14.093 --> 00:04:16.383
Chibong shook his head.

56
00:04:16.384 --> 00:04:23.325
"The old royal villa is there. Soldiers guard the city closely."

57
00:04:23.326 --> 00:04:31.938
"Hmm," Gildong said. "I know a way to distract the soldiers."

